  = note: both targets lie in different children of the <scxml> root, which is not a <parallel> and can have only one active child; a multi-target set must form a legal state configuration
  = note: removing `left` (keeping `right`) would leave `left` unreachable: no other transition, `initial`, or history default enters it
  = note: removing `right` (keeping `left`) would leave `right` unreachable: no other transition, `initial`, or history default enters it
  = help: keep one target and add a transition that enters the other state, or place both in different regions of a common `<parallel>` ancestor
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §3.11 Legal State Configurations and Specifications
